    "title": "JCC Football earns 30th straight win over Pipestone - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Skylar Fisher ,\n1 days ago The Jackson County Central Huskies defeated the Pipestone Arrows 48-0 on Homecoming, earning their 30th consecutive victory. “That was an awesome milestone, we want to keep it rolling,” JCC head coach Tom Schuller said. “We are proud of it, there’s a lot of players on the football that have been apart of many of those 30 victories. It was special.” Read full article",
